{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "autoEstCont 会自动计算污染比例，这是 SoupX 1.6.2 文档明确描述的能力。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "autoEstCont\nAutomatically calculate the contamination fraction"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "该自动估计依赖 soup 中高表达且为某群体标记基因的基因，并在 cluster 层面计算污染比例。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "The idea of this method is that genes that are highly expressed in the soup and are marker genes for some population can be used to estimate the background contamination."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的 droplet UMI counts 和 sensible cluster labels 是可用上下文，但仅凭这两项不能确认 autoEstCont 所需的 SoupChannel 输入已完整构造。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:count_matrix",
        "user:clusters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：autoEstCont 的科学假设是通道内存在多种不同细胞类型且具有不同标记基因；同质细胞可能产生警告、错误或极高污染估计，这属于可检测性局限，不代表执行被阻止。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "This function assumes that the channel contains multiple distinct cell types with different marker genes. If you try and run it on a channel with very homogenous cells (e.g. a cell line, flow-sorted cells), you will likely get a warning, an error, and/or an extremely high contamination estimate."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：背景表达谱通常由低于 Nemp UMI 的空液滴估计，但来源未给出全局整数阈值或必需顺序，不能据此要求特定空液滴数量。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 7,
          "quote": "To estimate the background expression profile we consider all droplets with <Nemp UMIs, which we assume unambiguously do not contain cells."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "question": "你当前是否已经构造了 SoupChannel 对象，并且其中 tod（所有液滴计数矩阵）和 toc（仅含细胞的计数矩阵）分别对应哪些数据？",
    "missing_field": "soup_channel_inputs",
    "why_needed": "autoEstCont 需要基于 SoupChannel 中的液滴计数与细胞计数来估计背景和污染比例；仅知道存在 droplet UMI counts 和 cluster labels，无法判断 tod/toc 是否已正确分离并传入，这会改变所需补充的数据或参数。"
  }
}
